        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka ji perin Isiraili jokwor pajo jokengila jo kwoŋbedo jotimo reco kwoŋin, to jowire bongin kendo to jobino i Ot pa Were me, pusirok gi mwolo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "winji jo gi polo. Cwaki reco pajo, aka idwoki jo i lowo m'imiyo kwarere pajo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“K'itweyo koth kwoŋbedo ji perin jotimo reco kwoŋin, ka jopusere to joŋiyo Ot pa Were me kwayin gi mwolo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "winji jo gi polo. Cwaki reco pa ŋecin perin Joisiraili. Fonji jo timo gimo'tire. Kenyo, Awi Rwoth, dhiri koth i lowo perin me, m'imiyo ji perin paka lim pajo alunja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka kec kosa two nundu obedi i lowo, kosa koyo malieth kosa tome bonyo, onyeki cemo, kosa jokwor pa ji perin jomonji jo iy'acel kwoŋ tindin pajo madongo, kosa two obedi i dier jo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Joisiraili perin mogo, wok i ŋuto ma cuny jo, jotiŋ cingi jo malo i Ot pa Were me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "winji kwayo pajo. Winji jo gi peco perin i polo, cwaki jo, aka kony jo. In kende iŋat'iŋeyo paro ma cuny nyatoro. Tiyi gi kisi nyatoro paka yenyere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋey jowolworin i kwo pajo je i lowo m'imiyo kwarere mawan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I nger acel ka japath, ma k'obedo acel kwoŋ ji perin owinji kwoŋ dwoŋ perin kodi gigipiny madongo m'itieko timo ri ji perin, to bino lamin kodi kwayin i Ot pa Were me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "winji kwayo pere. I polo, kam'ibed'iye, winji go aka tim gima go kwayin timo, ŋey nonin je i piny gibe jowoŋeyin aka jowowinjin, paka ji perin Isiraili jotimo. Kenyo jobino ŋeyo nike Ot pa Were m'ageto me kabedo m'iripo lamin'iye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“K'imiyo ji perin cik kadho i lweny gi jokwor pajo to jokwayin, kama jobed'iye je, ka joŋiyo tindi madwoŋ me m'iyero kodi Ot pa Were m'ageto rin me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "winji kwayo pajo. Winji jo gi polo aka miy jo loyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka ji perin jotimi reco kwoŋin, kole ongoye ŋata kitim reco, to i nge perin iweyo jokwor pajo kikengila jo, t'itero jo paka jotwec i lowo man, bor kosa cegin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kucel ka joŋuti reco pajo i lowo m'oter'iye jo paka jotwec, to jopusere, to joywak rin i lowo no, ka jowaco ni, ‘Watimo reco, watimo gi komo; aka watimo gikidakana,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jopusere gi cuny jo je kodi adundo pajo je i lowo pa jokwor pajo, ka joŋiyo lowo me, m'imiyo kwarere pajo, tindi madwoŋ me m'iyero, kodi Ot pa Were m'ageto rin me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kenyo winji kwayo pajo kodi ywak pajo gi polo kam'ibed'iye, maki wor gi jo aka icwaki reco pajo je.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
